  "description": "Measured impact across the service-call graph: which services are actually\naffected, classified direct / upstream / downstream, with error and call counts\nattached as evidence.\n\nDeterministic \u2014 `blast-radius/compute` reads the call graph and the counts. No\nmodel is asked to guess which services are affected, which is the property that\nmakes this citable. It is the same operator `incident/incident-rca` runs as one\nof its evidence steps, offered on its own because \"what else depends on\ncheckout?\" is a question you ask without having an incident open.\n",
